 "remarks": "This completely modernized New Canaan Cape, is truly one of a kind! Masterfully renovated from top to bottom by its owners with mindful artistic charm, and with attention to detail, and open spaces allowing for the beauty of the outside sunlight and gardens to spill into the home. Immerse yourself in the pristine pool, while overlooking the the pond. Enjoy the whole house Sonos sound system. The graciously oversized primary bedroom offers vaulted ceilings and a private balcony. There is plenty of room for guests with a bonus (5th) bedroom, and also a home office for your convenience. The chef's kitchen, and massive island and living room will be a favorite place to gather with your friends and family.",
